	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Fuissem tuis literis delinitus, nisi nota mihi esset mea tenuitas.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Voluntas mihi <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>non defuit, si parem habuissem dicendi facultatem.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed iuvabit extare quomodocunque <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>scriptam istius exempli memoriam.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Si vita longior contingat, non negligam aliam <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>oportunitatem.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sed vereor, ne prius opprimamur omnes vel cladibus ecclesiae confecti vel <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>crudelitate perditissimi tyranni<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> laniati.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Audio illum occupare praecipu[a]s imperii civitates, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>accipere nova auxilia ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName>, moliri denique crudelissima.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Victoria nobis erit expectanda <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>de coelo, alioqui viribus humanis nimium sumus<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>Vorlage:</hi> summus.</note> labefactati.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Nuper accepi ex <placeName ref="l473">Sancto <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Gallo</placeName> tyrannum ipsum esse vita defunctum, quod quia non video postea alicuius gravioris <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>sententiae autoritate confirmatum, arbitror fuisse vanum rumorem.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p18250">Mauricii</persName> per<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>fidia audimus hic quoque crudelia.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Si quid habes vel de caesare vel de <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quaeso, ut communices.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Veniam ad vos, uti spero, intra mensem, equidem maluissem <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ad festum natalitium, sed detineor hic invitus propter quaedam negocia.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Literas ad <lb xml:id="p1z13"/><placeName ref="l473">Sangallum</placeName> mittes et ignosce, quaeso, meae audatiae, qui te onerem perpetua importunitate.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName>, 17. decembris 1546.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8032">Franciscus Dryander</persName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><ptr target="zzlzl16407-1A" type="zzl"/>Literas, quas mitto, accepi ex <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><placeName ref="l522">Venetiis</placeName> ad te <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>a quodam <placeName ref="l834">Italo</placeName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p152">Altieri</persName>. Nicht zu verstehen ist vermutlich: accepi a quodam Italo literas ad te, sondern eher: accepi literas ad te a quodam Italo. Mit dem Brief ist wohl <ref target="file11679">Nr. 1636</ref> 0 vom 13. November gemeint.</note>, de quo plura coram deo volente<ptr target="zzlzl16407-1E" type="zzl"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro domino <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Henrico Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fratri carissimo.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
